abstract: >-
  A fault-injection study of deep neural networks quantised to the OCP Microscaling
  (MX) formats, with mxfi, a bit-accurate library for injecting faults into MX
  element codes and shared scales.
keywords:
  - microscaling
  - MXFP
  - fault injection
  - DNN reliability
  - silent data corruption
